#. module: stock_picking_group_by_date_deadline
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_group_by_date_deadline.field_res_config_settings__deadline_date_rounding_threshold
msgid ""
"Number of hours used to round down deadline date time on stock move. This "
"gives a chance to merge moves or picking with the same deadline. (ie: if set"
" to 6 hours, and deadline is 17:22:35 then deadline will be force to "
"12:00:00) Default is 24 hours for once a day"
msgstr ""

#. module: stock_picking_group_by_date_deadline
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_picking_group_by_date_deadline.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Number of hours used to round down deadline date time on stock move. While "
"avoiding to mix moves or pickings with different deadlines, this setting "
"gives a chance to merge them. (e.g., if set to 6 hours and deadline is "
"17:22:35 then deadline will be forced to 12:00:00). If not set, the default "
"is 24 hours to force once a day."
msgstr ""

